cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "eduLIMS"
abstract: >-
  An open-source laboratory information management system (LIMS) for
  practical laboratory education. Students register samples,
  upload and check measurements and submit lab reports; teachers grade with a
  rubric and follow a KPI dashboard. Measurement data is stored as openEHR
  compositions in FerroEHR.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ruben
    family-names: Talstra
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Vernum-Projecten/eduLIMS"
url: "https://edulims.eu"
keywords:
  - LIMS
  - laboratory education
  - openEHR
  - HL7 v2
  - TanStack Start
version: 0.0.0
